        "ephanna": "evidence_gap"
      },
      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The Session 12 council chamber fight includes the 6 players, the Wolf, Thalia, and 10 guards (8 regular, 2 elite), with additional guards possibly arriving as reinforcements; no explicit claim confirms council members are present during the fight.\n\nIn detail:\n- The **players (group of 6)** are actively in battle (Claim 1, 4).\n- The **Wolf** is present in the Council Room and is the central adversary (Claims 12, 29), standing at **Thalia\u2019s shoulder** (Claim 13).\n- **Thalia (Half-Elf Commander of the Guard)** is present and initially acts under the Wolf\u2019s influence (Claims 30\u201334, 36).\n- **Guards** are present: **8 regular and 2 elite** (Claim 42), stationed around the room (Claim 44). Some are corrupted and assist the Wolf (Claims 43, 50).\n- **Additional guards** may be arriving due to alarms (Claims 45, 66).\n\nNotably, while the setting is the **Council Chamber**, there is **no explicit claim that council members are present during the fight**, despite earlier mention of the players recounting their story.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Combatants: 6 players, Wolf, Thalia, 10 guards (+ possible reinforcements)\n- Guard status: Mixed corruption (half regular, elite heavily corrupted)\n- Positioning: Guards ring the chamber; Wolf at Thalia\u2019s shoulder",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
