      "answer": "TL;DR: Torrin Flamescale serves as Master Smith and a Guild representative (wording varies slightly), Rurik Stonehammer is Chief Architect and handles infrastructure, and there\u2019s no information provided about Merril.\n\nTorrin Flamescale:\n- CANON (claims 1 & 2): Holds the title Master Smith and serves as a Representative of the Guilds / Craft Guilds. These are functionally aligned but phrased slightly differently; no clear conflict, just naming variation.\n- CANON (claim 3): Affiliated with the Guilds faction.\n\nRurik Stonehammer:\n- CANON (claims 6 & 7): Chief Architect and Representative of Infrastructure.\n- CANON (claims 8\u201311): Oversees structural integrity, understands city layout (including hidden passages and sewers), and focuses on defense safety.\n\nMerril:\n- Not present in the provided claims; no role or title can be determined.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Governance Roles: Master Smith (Torrin Flamescale), Guild Representative (Torrin Flamescale), Chief Architect (Rurik Stonehammer), Infrastructure Representative (Rurik Stonehammer)\n- Factions: Guilds (Torrin Flamescale)\n- Expertise: City structure and defenses (Rurik Stonehammer)",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
